      {
        "id": "k777-action-priority",
        "name": {
          "ko": "참관으로 돌아간다",
          "en": "Return to observation"
        },
        "description": {
          "ko": "2125년 교량 습격 훈련에서 최초 보고가 틀리자 참관 칸을 다시 열었다.",
          "en": "In 2125, when the first report of a bridge-raid exercise proved wrong, he reopened the observation column. By this deed the signature of the power installation patrol post rose into the ledger."
        },
        "behavior": {
          "ko": "2125년 교량 습격 훈련에서 최초 보고가 틀리자 참관 칸을 다시 열었다.",
          "en": "In 2125, when the first report of a bridge-raid exercise proved wrong, he reopened the observation column. By this deed the signature of the power installation patrol post rose into the ledger."
        },
        "stress": {
          "ko": "전력장치 순찰대 당직이 비면 규격맹의 통행이 강국 볼모가 되는 것.",
          "en": "That the power installation patrol duty post would stand empty and the Alliance's passage would become a hostage of the great powers."
        },
        "relationship": {
          "ko": "같은 생활권 선배 당직과 인수인계로 묶인다.",
          "en": "Bound by handover to the senior duty line of the same living quarters."
        },
        "effects": []
      },
